scenario: DISP-4K-01
title: 4K screen and cable link
area: Display
rows: F-DISP-01, F-DISP-14
machines: any
needs: person
prereq: A 4K screen connected with a cable you trust (HDMI 2.0, DisplayPort or USB-C).
step: Open Settings, Display and read the connected outputs.
expect: The screen is listed with its name and its modes, including the 3840 by 2160 mode.
clause: F-DISP-01.listed
step: Choose 3840 by 2160 and confirm.
expect: The picture becomes sharp at 4K, the screen does not go dark, and the page offers Keep or Go back.
clause: F-DISP-14.mode
step: Look at the whole screen for one minute.
expect: No flicker, no blank flashes, no lines.
clause: F-DISP-14.stable
step: Choose a lower mode such as 1920 by 1080.
expect: The picture changes at once and stays stable.
clause: F-DISP-14.lower
